        "title": "Portfolio Theory - Markowitz, CAPM, Factor Models",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Portfolio theory answers: **given a set of risky assets, how should you combine them to\nmaximize expected return for a given risk level?** The mathematics is convex optimization\napplied to a stochastic problem — Markowitz (1952) founded the field, CAPM extended it to\nequilibrium, and factor models added explanatory power."
